{"hw":"οἴκαδε","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">οἴκαδε</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">οἴκ-αδε</span> (Delph. <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ϝοίκαδε</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">GDI</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2561</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">C</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">42</span> </span>), <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> = οἶκόνδε, <b class=\"lex-tr\">to one's house, home,</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">country, homewards,</b> freq. in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hom.</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.170</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.176</span> </span>, al.: freq. in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> </span> (<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">N.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.76</span> </span>, al.), Trag. (as <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ag.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1337</span> </span> (anap.)), Com. (as <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Nu.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">618</span> </span>), and <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Att.</span> </span> Prose (as <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">328b</span> </span>). </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">to people's houses,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Telecl.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.6</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">III</span> = οἴκοι, <b class=\"lex-tr\">at home,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.3.4</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">An.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.7.57</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Luc.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Dem.Enc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">26</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hld.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.22</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Phalar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ep.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">143</span> </span>, etc.</div></div>"}